This project is an independent implementation of the Time-Consistent (TiC)
credit-rating methodology (Y. Yang), combined with standard KMV/Merton
structural-model machinery. The methodology is third-party intellectual
property: equation and proposition numbers are cited in the docstrings of the
modules that implement TiC formulas, and the implementation must not be
represented as original methodology.

